WEBVTT

00:07:57.681 --> 00:08:00.559
from industries where there were
transferable skills,

00:08:00.559 --> 00:08:03.729
such as music videos,
advertising and theater.

00:08:04.813 --> 00:08:06.649
Within a year,

00:08:07.316 --> 00:08:14.156
Landgraf had turned FX from being
the least diverse network in America

00:08:14.198 --> 00:08:15.741
to one of the most.

00:08:15.783 --> 00:08:20.454
And they had also managed to increase
their diverse directing pool

00:08:20.454 --> 00:08:22.164
to just over half.

00:08:22.873 --> 00:08:27.586
Critical and commercial
success would follow,

00:08:27.586 --> 00:08:30.798
with hits such as "Atlanta"
and "Better Things."